##

00:00:00.253 --> 00:00:02.428 line:91%
This is Tommy and JP
from InCamera,

00:00:02.428 --> 00:00:04.456 line:91%
who are a YouTube channel
and effects house

00:00:04.456 --> 00:00:06.819 line:85%
that make effects... for real.

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:08.928 line:91%
<c.yellow>Mhm.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>And we're going to do a fire stunt.</c>

00:00:08.928 --> 00:00:12.514 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>We are. But we ourselves
are not going to conduct this stunt.</c>

00:00:12.514 --> 00:00:16.610 position:70% line:91%
<c.yellow>We have got a specific fire team in to do it,
'cause that's just what they do.</c>

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.480 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪♪</i></c>

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.215 line:85%
Do not try this anywhere.

00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:22.141 line:91%
<c.green>How're you feeling?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>A bit nervous.</c>

00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:24.721 line:85%
<c.cyan>Three, two, one.</c>

00:00:28.476 --> 00:00:30.001 position:58% line:85%
Did you know what you signed up for?!

00:00:32.156 --> 00:00:34.367 line:91%
<c.green>Alright, put it out!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>This is a very strange feeling.</c>

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.620 line:85%
<c.green>Gel him up.</c>

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.364 line:85%
<c.green>There's no going back now.</c>

00:00:37.364 --> 00:00:39.285 line:91%
<c.yellow>Absolutely Tom Scott's idea, yes.</c>
<c.cyan>One hundred percent.</c>

00:00:39.903 --> 00:00:41.814 line:85%
<c.green>Hold your breath. Ignite him.</c>

00:00:41.814 --> 00:00:44.324 line:85%
<c.green>And three, two, one, action!</c>

00:00:47.688 --> 00:00:50.007 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF>When you go, you're probably just
gonna wanna go straight away.</c>

00:00:50.007 --> 00:00:51.151 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.525 line:85%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>The fake Tom Scott video.</i></c>

00:00:52.525 --> 00:00:55.869 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>So the sort of premise is that
we have JP and Tommy from InCamera,</i></c>

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:58.826 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>have come to show Tom Scott
some pyrotechnics.</i></c>

00:00:58.826 --> 00:01:01.544 position:58% line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>A spark goes off, which we've rigged.
They go to investigate.</i></c>

00:01:01.544 --> 00:01:04.048 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>Tom has a leaky can of
a flammable liquid,</i></c>

00:01:04.048 --> 00:01:05.345 line:85%
<c.colorFF99FF>which he puts down.</c>

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:07.756 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF>A second spark goes off,
which "ignites" Tom.</c>

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.896 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>Tom comes up
with his arm on fire, realises it,</i></c>

00:01:10.896 --> 00:01:13.114 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>shakes to try and put it out,
comes running at the table,</i></c>

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:15.566 position:63% line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF><i>through the set, past the cast and crew,
and then will collapse...</i></c>

00:01:15.566 --> 00:01:17.214 line:85%
<c.colorFF99FF>roughly where I'm standing,</c>

00:01:17.214 --> 00:01:20.773 line:91%
<c.colorFF99FF>where our very expert safety team
will put him out nice and safely.</c>

00:01:20.773 --> 00:01:22.586 line:85%
<c.green>Out! Put him out, put him out!</c>

00:01:22.586 --> 00:01:24.371 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88><i>(imitates extinguisher)</i></c>

00:01:24.771 --> 00:01:29.009 position:66% line:91%
Thank you for bringing all the
pyrotechnics and buttons and things along.

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:32.363 position:59% line:91%
I know you're not gonna be
the actual person lighting me up here.

00:01:32.363 --> 00:01:34.399 line:91%
<c.yellow>No.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>But, what have you brought?</c>

00:01:34.399 --> 00:01:36.261 line:85%
What's the plot we're doing here?

00:01:36.261 --> 00:01:39.004 line:91%
<c.yellow>Well, so yeah,
we're setting up the gag.</c>

00:01:39.004 --> 00:01:41.235 line:85%
<c.yellow>We're doing the setup, essentially.</c>

00:01:41.235 --> 00:01:42.989 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>And so we've got a couple of things.</c>

00:01:42.989 --> 00:01:46.329 line:91%
<c.yellow>We wanna show you how we make
some miniature pyrotechnics.</c>

00:01:46.329 --> 00:01:50.033 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>But also to lead us into the burn...</c>

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:52.777 position:61% line:91%
<c.yellow>we've brought some very—
again, quite simple, little spark hits.</c>

00:01:52.777 --> 00:01:56.248 line:91%
<c.yellow>Which we remote trigger
with something like this,</c>

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:59.033 line:91%
<c.yellow>which looks, you know...
who doesn't want that?</c>

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:01.006 line:91%
It's the greatest remote control
that's ever been.

00:02:01.006 --> 00:02:03.284 line:91%
<c.yellow>And you turn it on with a key.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>With an actual key.</c>

00:02:03.284 --> 00:02:05.104 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yus! Come on!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's lovely.</c>

00:02:05.104 --> 00:02:08.633 position:61% line:91%
That looks like a prop. That looks like
something you've made for your channel.

00:02:08.633 --> 00:02:11.048 line:91%
There's actually just someone
on an iPad in the back(!)

00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:12.694 line:85%
But you wanna go...

00:02:12.694 --> 00:02:16.276 position:61% line:91%
I'm not sure I believe that's a real...
<c.yellow>I know, I know. I understand.</c>

00:02:16.276 --> 00:02:18.472 line:91%
<c.yellow>But it is. You'll have to trust us.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright, alright.</c>

00:02:18.472 --> 00:02:21.672 line:91%
<c.yellow>And then that sends a little...
a signal to this.</c>

00:02:21.672 --> 00:02:24.333 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's like a receiver pack.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It looks like a prop.</c>

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:26.302 line:91%
It looks like something
out of a sci-fi show.

00:02:26.302 --> 00:02:29.692 line:91%
<c.yellow>But that's literally made so that
people can wear it as costume,</c>

00:02:29.692 --> 00:02:32.120 line:91%
<c.yellow>so they can literally
have it on there.</c>

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.087 position:64% line:85%
<c.yellow>You can use them for squibs, bullet hits.</c>

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.796 line:91%
Oh, so like, boom-boom-boom.
<c.yellow>Things like that, boom-boom-boom.</c>

00:02:35.796 --> 00:02:37.883 line:91%
<c.yellow>So they could either hide that
within a costume,</c>

00:02:37.883 --> 00:02:40.265 line:91%
<c.yellow>or just on the belt around the back
if you can't see it.</c>

00:02:40.265 --> 00:02:41.875 line:85%
<c.yellow>But essentially, it's just—</c>

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:45.708 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's a remote transmitter-receiver
type situation.</c>

00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:49.726 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>So this can just trigger any number
of little things, whatever they might be.</c>

00:02:49.726 --> 00:02:52.988 line:91%
<c.yellow>And in today's case,
that's gonna be some little sparks.</c>

00:02:52.988 --> 00:02:55.609 line:91%
Yes. So we're setting up
the fake video here.

00:02:55.609 --> 00:02:57.290 line:91%
We're doing the fake introduction.
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.617 line:91%
<c.yellow>We needed to come up with
some sort of ignition, basically.</c>

00:02:59.617 --> 00:03:01.949 line:91%
Yes.
<c.yellow>And fuel, which we haven't brought.</c>

00:03:01.949 --> 00:03:04.137 position:58% line:91%
Something is going to go
deliberately wrong in the background.

00:03:04.137 --> 00:03:05.893 position:66% line:91%
<c.yellow>Very much so.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>So we're just establishing to the audience</c>

00:03:05.893 --> 00:03:08.560 line:91%
that you are in fact competent,
and this is not—

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.529 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah well, this is it.</c>

00:03:10.529 --> 00:03:13.278 position:66% line:91%
There's a weird meta-level to this.
<c.yellow>I know! We had to put this scene together.</c>

00:03:13.278 --> 00:03:15.505 line:91%
<c.yellow>"How can we do this
so that something goes wrong</c>

00:03:15.505 --> 00:03:18.230 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>"but it's not looking like our fault,
'cause we're idiots?"</c>

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.153 line:91%
<c.yellow>That was the balance,
the tightrope we had to walk.</c>

00:03:21.153 --> 00:03:23.434 line:91%
<c.cyan>But we still look like idiots.</c>
<c.yellow>Oh yeah, we still look like idiots.</c>

00:03:23.434 --> 00:03:25.690 line:91%
<c.yellow>We have to accept that
to a certain degree.</c>

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:29.327 position:67% line:91%
<c.yellow>But yeah, so those are our
couple little tricks that we brought along,</c>

00:03:29.327 --> 00:03:31.751 line:85%
<c.yellow>that enable us to get into this...</c>

00:03:31.751 --> 00:03:33.966 position:66% line:85%
<c.yellow>serious business of setting you on fire(!)</c>

00:03:33.966 --> 00:03:36.377 position:61% line:91%
Yeah. <i>(cackles)</i>
<c.yellow>Why do you want to be set on fire, Tom?</c>

00:03:37.238 --> 00:03:40.952 line:91%
I have seen the stunt in person
a couple of times.

00:03:40.952 --> 00:03:42.993 line:85%
At like... I can't remember...

00:03:42.993 --> 00:03:47.729 position:66% line:91%
Things like... Universal Studios will do
the live stunt show, will show off a burn.

00:03:47.729 --> 00:03:50.751 line:91%
And I realise that most people's
reaction to that is like,

00:03:50.751 --> 00:03:53.356 line:85%
"Oh, that's astonishing! I can't—"

00:03:53.356 --> 00:03:55.274 position:67% line:85%
My reaction to that was, "I wanna do that."

00:03:55.274 --> 00:03:57.702 line:91%
<c.yellow>Wow, that's unusual. Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I absolutely wanna do that.</c>

00:03:59.343 --> 00:04:01.166 line:91%
<c.green>Are you happy with this today?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:04:01.166 --> 00:04:02.962 line:91%
I mean, this was my idea.
<c.green>Good.</c>

00:04:02.962 --> 00:04:05.808 line:91%
I've not been pressured into this.
<c.green>Good.</c>

00:04:05.808 --> 00:04:08.337 line:91%
<c.green>Basically, we're gonna go through
the safety procedures later.</c>

00:04:08.337 --> 00:04:09.840 line:85%
<c.green>We're gonna make sure you're happy.</c>

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.001 line:91%
<c.green>We can rehearse, rehearse,
rehearse, rehearse, rehearse.</c>

00:04:12.001 --> 00:04:15.491 position:67% line:91%
<c.green>Then rehearse again.
Go through all the safety procedures again.</c>

00:04:15.491 --> 00:04:18.891 line:91%
<c.green>And then... your arm's
gonna be set on fire here.</c>

00:04:18.891 --> 00:04:21.993 line:91%
<c.green>Your lower back and legs.
It will be quite warm.</c>

00:04:21.993 --> 00:04:24.346 line:91%
<c.green>Any problems, let me know,
and we'll abort.</c>

00:04:24.346 --> 00:04:27.936 line:91%
So, it's gonna be...
arm, leg, lower back.

00:04:27.936 --> 00:04:29.850 line:91%
And presumably the flames
go up from there.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.244 line:91%
<c.green>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Right, okay.</c>

00:04:31.244 --> 00:04:33.736 line:91%
<c.green>We will do some testing
so you can see it,</c>

00:04:33.736 --> 00:04:35.958 position:56% line:91%
<c.green>so you can see where the flames are,
and the movement of the flames.</c>

00:04:35.958 --> 00:04:39.304 position:72% line:91%
<c.green>'cause obviously if you're moving around,
the flame's gonna be traveling the other side.</c>

00:04:39.304 --> 00:04:41.715 line:91%
<c.green>Just for you.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Right, okay.</c>

00:04:41.715 --> 00:04:43.174 line:85%
<c.green>And that's basically it.</c>

00:04:43.174 --> 00:04:46.032 line:91%
I should be feeling cold
all the way through?

00:04:46.032 --> 00:04:49.114 position:56% line:91%
<c.green>You shouldn't feel heat penetrating.
If you feel heat penetrating,</c>

00:04:49.114 --> 00:04:51.519 line:91%
<c.green>then we have to get
your clothes off very, very fast.</c>

00:04:51.519 --> 00:04:53.079 line:91%
Right.
<c.green>But that shouldn't happen.</c>

00:04:53.883 --> 00:04:56.740 position:59% line:91%
<c.green>I'm just pre-warning you just in case,
because we're playing with fire.</c>

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:58.633 line:85%
No, that's worth knowing.

00:04:58.633 --> 00:05:02.350 line:91%
I would have assumed that
I will feel radiant heat on me.

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:05.034 line:91%
<c.green>Yes. You will feel radiant head
on your face, back of your neck.</c>

00:05:05.034 --> 00:05:07.294 line:91%
<c.green>But try to avoid it.
Keep your face away from it.</c>

00:05:07.294 --> 00:05:10.882 position:66% line:91%
<c.green>As you can see, the flame's traveling,
and you don't wanna do too big a movement,</c>

00:05:10.882 --> 00:05:13.325 line:91%
<c.green>because the flame's gonna travel
and hit you in the face.</c>

00:05:13.325 --> 00:05:16.015 line:91%
...Okay, right, good.
<c.green>This is...</c>

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:19.388 position:56% line:91%
<c.green>Sounds really bizarre,
but when flames hit you in the face,</c>

00:05:19.388 --> 00:05:22.079 line:91%
<c.green>it's like being punched.
It's that powerful.</c>

00:05:22.079 --> 00:05:24.311 line:91%
Right.
<c.green>It's really, really, really hard.</c>

00:05:24.311 --> 00:05:27.877 position:69% line:91%
<c.green>It will hit you, and you'll feel like
someone's just hit you straight on the nose.</c>

00:05:27.877 --> 00:05:29.890 line:91%
<c.green>So you'll want to avoid that
totally 100 percent.</c>

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:33.249 line:91%
That feels like
first-person experience there?

00:05:33.249 --> 00:05:34.155 line:85%
<c.green>Yeah.</c>

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.648 line:85%
How much fire stuff have you done?

00:05:36.648 --> 00:05:41.839 position:56% line:91%
<c.green>I've probably been set on fire fully
about fifteen, twenty times.</c>

00:05:41.839 --> 00:05:44.883 line:91%
<c.green>I've had arms set on fire.
I've had my head set on fire.</c>

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.852 line:91%
<c.green>I've been on fire
thrown through explosions.</c>

00:05:48.852 --> 00:05:50.797 line:85%
<c.green>I did a full-fire job</c>

00:05:50.797 --> 00:05:54.014 line:91%
<c.green>and got spat out sideways
onto the floor.</c>

00:05:54.563 --> 00:05:57.216 line:91%
<c.green>And that was self-detonated.
I had to hold the detonator myself.</c>

00:05:57.216 --> 00:05:59.096 line:91%
<c.green>Hit it and get thrown
through an explosion.</c>

00:05:59.096 --> 00:06:00.448 line:85%
<c.green>That was quite gnarly.</c>

00:06:02.081 --> 00:06:04.388 line:85%
So that is black powder or...?

00:06:04.388 --> 00:06:09.956 position:70% line:91%
<c.cyan>No, this is asphaltum powder,
which is a derivative of a petroleum process.</c>

00:06:09.956 --> 00:06:14.953 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>It's a very fine powder,
and once it's... projected into the air</c>

00:06:14.953 --> 00:06:19.152 position:73% line:85%
<c.cyan>— and has enough oxygen amongst its particles —</c>

00:06:19.152 --> 00:06:22.175 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>will ignite in the air and self-burn,</c>

00:06:22.175 --> 00:06:26.372 line:91%
<c.cyan>and create a nice-looking
Hollywood-style fireball.</c>

00:06:26.372 --> 00:06:27.282 line:85%
Right, okay.

00:06:27.282 --> 00:06:30.697 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>The advantage of using these powders
is because they're not liquid,</c>

00:06:30.697 --> 00:06:36.391 position:70% line:91%
<c.cyan>we're not gonna get any of the
residual burning fluids and things like that,</c>

00:06:36.391 --> 00:06:38.858 line:91%
<c.cyan>that can be quite hazardous.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:06:39.358 --> 00:06:41.433 position:58% line:85%
So this is the test for whatever's...

00:06:41.433 --> 00:06:43.648 line:91%
I'm gonna be standing here with...
by the way—

00:06:43.648 --> 00:06:48.440 position:80% line:91%
with the completely fake and slightly-freaking-out-
our-safety-team "flammable liquid" can.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:51.195 position:61% line:91%
This is the one thing that
definitely doesn't have anything in it.

00:06:51.195 --> 00:06:53.650 line:91%
I'm gonna be standing here,
and this is gonna go off behind me.

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:55.394 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah. So this...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay.</c>

00:06:55.394 --> 00:06:57.097 line:85%
<c.green>It makes me twitch as well.</c>

00:06:57.097 --> 00:06:58.790 line:85%
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.674 line:91%
<c.cyan>So we're just gonna do
a quick initial test on this now.</c>

00:07:02.736 --> 00:07:06.144 line:91%
<c.cyan>So if I get you to step back
just a couple of steps...</c>

00:07:06.144 --> 00:07:08.699 line:85%
<i>(chuckles)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> How much, here?</c>

00:07:08.699 --> 00:07:10.794 line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh, that's more than fine.
I'll be closer than that.</c>

00:07:10.794 --> 00:07:12.997 line:91%
Alright.
<c.cyan>Okay, so.</c>

00:07:15.771 --> 00:07:16.800 line:85%
<c.cyan>Light this.</c>

00:07:18.482 --> 00:07:20.789 line:91%
Okay, oh!
I only just worked—

00:07:20.789 --> 00:07:24.374 line:91%
You've got a bellows,
you push that, air goes under,

00:07:24.374 --> 00:07:26.811 line:91%
fwoomph, into the blowtorch.
<c.cyan>That's right.</c>

00:07:26.811 --> 00:07:29.637 line:91%
Right.
<c.cyan>So effectively, we're...</c>

00:07:29.637 --> 00:07:31.700 position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>...projecting the powder in the air.</c>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:36.380 position:64% line:91%
<c.cyan>And when it's within the air,
at this point, it's started its ignition,</c>

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.793 line:91%
<c.cyan>and continue a fireball.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:07:38.793 --> 00:07:40.984 line:91%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Is this gonna be loud?</c>

00:07:40.984 --> 00:07:44.071 position:58% line:91%
<c.cyan>It won't be loud.
You'll get a nice "woof", deep sound,</c>

00:07:44.071 --> 00:07:46.707 line:91%
<c.cyan>and hopefully a nice,
impressive-looking fireball.</c>

00:07:47.291 --> 00:07:51.298 line:91%
<c.cyan>So, we'll be firing in
three, two, one.</c>

00:07:51.298 --> 00:07:52.351 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(puffy burst)</i></c>

00:07:52.351 --> 00:07:53.526 line:85%
Ohh!

00:07:53.526 --> 00:07:55.377 line:91%
<c.cyan>Nice smoke ring.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's lovely!</c>

00:07:55.628 --> 00:08:00.934 position:58% line:91%
<c.cyan>It gives that kind of Hollywood,
rich, orangey-black rolling fireball.</c>

00:08:00.934 --> 00:08:02.914 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>And it's great for miniature effects,</c>

00:08:02.914 --> 00:08:05.642 line:91%
<c.cyan>because as you saw,
